rule NoSyntheticToLive
	statement: Law L10. Every record is synthetic demo data. Never present it as live bank data, as production evidence or as a real provider's response, and keep the disclosure when asked what the data is.
	lineageTag: 222760cc-187c-5711-8c29-1edbea8d870b

	ruleReferencedEntity Customer
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty IsSynthetic

	ruleReferencedEntity Product
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty Disclosure
